 style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;Khôi&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;4.69&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;4.68&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;UC19, UC20&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;Acknowledge Operations Alert and Monitor Escalated Alerts&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;2&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;kept — refreshed against code&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;Khôi&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;4.70&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;4.69&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;UC16&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;Track Investment Portfolio and Notifications (read-only)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;1&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;kept — refreshed against code&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;Khôi&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;4.71&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;4.70&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;UC42, UC43&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;Monitor Platform Reports; Export the hash-chained Audit Log&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;2&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;kept — refreshed against code&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;Khôi&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;4.72&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="70" width="1480" height="699" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="4" value="&lt;b&gt;Legend&lt;/b&gt; (every Sequence Diagram, Figure 4.36–4.70) — solid filled arrow: synchronous call named after an operation of the receiving class · open arrow: asynchronous message · dashed: reply · «controller» = boundary (HTTP API), «service» / «background job» = control, «persistence» AppDbContext = entity access: every message to it is an EF Core operation (Set&amp;lt;T&amp;gt;() queries, Add, SaveChangesAsync, ExecuteUpdateAsync…, Figure 4.87) with its effect after &quot;—&quot; · «interface» = port to an external system (sandbox or fake adapter) · grey dashed lifeline / fragment and grey message labelled «planned» = Register v1.4, not on develop @ 420a379 (planned calls keep a solid line, because a dashed line means a reply in UML) · ProblemDetails code on error replies.&lt;br&gt;Long flows are split into parts &quot;(k/N)&quot; with the same figure number, so that each part stays readable when printed on A4: a part shows only the lifelines it uses, and consecutive parts are joined by a ref fragment; a fragment cut by the split is closed and reopened with &quot;(continued)&quot;." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#94a3b8;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="775" width="1480" height="84" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram name="Index of figures (2 of 2)" id="Index_of_figures__2_of_2_"><mxGraphModel dx="1200" dy="800" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1654" pageHeight="1169" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="2" value="&lt;b&gt;Sequence Diagrams – notes on Figures 4.36–4.70 (page 2 of 2) — removed flows, use cases without an own diagram, conventions&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;v3.2 · 05/11/2026 · Register v1.4 · UML 2.5 · code: develop @ 420a379&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="10" width="1480" height="42" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="3" value="&lt;b&gt;Notes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• 35 flows on 77 pages: 16 kept (refreshed against code), 11 modified for Register v1.4, 8 new «planned»; 6 flows of the v2.0 set removed.&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Removed in v1.4 (still in code)&lt;/b&gt; — not drawn any more; the code on develop @ 420a379 still has them:&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;– UC46 Print and Activate Crab Tag (v2.0 Figure 4.55): TagsController (Label, Activate, Void) → TagsService; IHarvestTagCodeGenerator; crab_tag, crab_item_event TagPrinted / TagActivated.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;– UC33 Trace Crab by Tag Scan (v2.0 Figure 4.56): TraceController.Get(tag) → TraceService.GetAsync(code); tag_scan, v_traceability — replaced by UC33 Trace Order by QR Code «planned».&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;– UC24 Publish Product Listings (v2.0 Figure 4.57): ListingsController, OperatorListingsController, AdminListingsController → CatalogService, PriceAnomaly, ListingModerationService, LowStockMonitor; product_listing, price_history, price_check.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;– UC25 Browse Product Catalogue (v2.0 Figure 4.58): ListingsController.Browse / GetPublic / Image → CatalogService.BrowseAsync — replaced by UC25 Find Farms and Batches on Map «planned».&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;– UC26 Place Order (cart, retail checkout) (v2.0 Figure 4.59): OrdersController.Checkout → OrderService.CheckoutAsync, OrderPaymentHandler, StockReservation / StockRelease, ReservationExpiryService (retail part).&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;– UC13 Register Offtake Commitment (and UC23 claim window, PR #72 not merged) (v2.0 Figure 4.64): OfftakeController → OfftakeService, OfftakeDepositHandler; offtake_commitment, batch_offtake_price (the pre-order cap of UC27 still reads v_batch_commitment_cap).&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;– Pack by tag scan (UC29) (part of v2.0 Figure 4.61): OperatorOrdersController.Pack → OrderPackingService.PackAsync(orderNo, tagCodes).&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;– Water-quality thresholds and WaterQuality alert (UC17) (part of v2.0 Figure 4.52): ProductionLogsController.Thresholds / Configure → ProductionLogService.ThresholdsAsync / ConfigureAsync, Violations(request, thresholds); production_threshold_version; ph / water_temp_c / salinity_ppt of production_log; AlertType WaterQuality.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;– Pre-order balance issued at harvest (part of v2.0 Figure 4.60): PreorderBalanceJob → PreorderBalanceService.IssueForHarvestingBatchesAsync (total − deposit) — v1.4 issues the balance on the weighed kg at delivery.&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Main use cases without an own diagram&lt;/b&gt;:&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;– UC28 Track Order Status: read only, the same pattern as UC16: OrderTrackingController.List(filter, paging) / Get(orderNo) → OrderQueryService.ListMineAsync / GetMineAsync → Set&amp;lt;SalesOrder&amp;gt;().Where(customer).ToPagedAsync(paging); the status changes it shows are drawn in Figures 4.56, 4.57 and 4.58.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;– UC41 Configure Platform Parameters: CRUD only: FeeTiersController.List / Create / Update → FeeTierService.ListAsync / SaveAsync (fee tiers are the only parameters wired on develop); the deposit ratio, minimum contribution, reservation expiry, minimum order quantity and minimum pre-order ratio are «planned» parameters, snapshot on the Batch at approval (Figure 4.46).&lt;br&gt;• Design decisions of 05/11/2026, confirmed by the lead: Batch opening condition and refunds (Figure 4.38), contribution by box rows (Figure 4.36), deposit cases a–d with UC55 Cancel Bulk Pre-order (Figure 4.58), survival rate and the Standard Cost of funded boxes (Figure 4.40), balance on the weighed kg (Figure 4.57), InvoicedSale (Figure 4.59); every page that applies them carries the line &quot;Design decisions of 05/11/2026 applied here were confirmed by the lead.&quot;&lt;br&gt;• «planned» = required by Register v1.4 but not in the code yet (grey dashed lifeline and fragment, grey message labelled «planned»). Physical ERD and database script stay on the code (V001–V017).&lt;br&gt;• Messages to controllers are action names followed by the HTTP route; messages to the «persistence» AppDbContext are EF Core operations. Every lifeline class and every message name exists in the Class Diagrams (Figure 4.71 onwards). Figure numbers follow the other diagram sets (state machines 4.8–4.30, activity 4.31–4.35); the Was column and every &quot;v2.0 Figure&quot; reference keep the old v2.0 numbers." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#fffbeb;strokeColor=#d97706;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="80" width="1480" height="408" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram name="UC10 Reserve rows &amp; capital (1 of 5)" id="UC10_Reserve_rows__amp__capital__1_of_5_"><mxGraphModel dx="1200" dy="800" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1654" pageHeight="1169" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="c2" value="Investor" style="shape=umlLifeline;participant=umlActor;perimeter=lifelinePerimeter;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;container=1;collapsible=0;recursiveResize=0;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=36;outlineConnect=0;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Segoe UI;size=54;fontSize=12;whiteSpace=nowrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="115" y="96" width="40" height="894" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c3" value="«controller»&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;:FundingController&lt;/b&gt;" style="shape=umlLifeline;perimeter=lifelinePerimeter;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;container=1;collapsible=0;recursiveResize=0;outlineConnect=0;fillColor=#f8fafc;strokeColor=#1e293b;size=40;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fillColor=#e0f2fe;size=54;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="250" y="96" width="190" height="894" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c4" value="«service»&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;:FundingService&lt;/b&gt;" style="shape=umlLifeline;perimeter=lifelinePerimeter;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;container=1;collapsible=0;recursiveResize=0;outlineConnect=0;fillColor=#f8fafc;strokeColor=#1e293b;size=40;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Segoe UI;size=54;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="460" y="96" width="190" height="894" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c5" value="«persistence»&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;:AppDbContext&lt;/b&gt;" style="shape=umlLifeline;perimeter=lifelinePerimeter;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;container=1;collapsible=0;recursiveResize=0;outlineConnect=0;fillColor=#f8fafc;strokeColor=#1e293b;size=40;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fillColor=#f1f5f9;size=54;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="670" y="96" width="190" height="894" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c6" value="«interface»&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;:IAuditLog&lt;/b&gt;" style="shape=umlLifeline;perimeter=lifelinePerimeter;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;container=1;collapsible=0;recursiveResize=0;outlineConnect=0;fillColor=#f8fafc;strokeColor=#1e293b;size=40;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fillColor=#fef3c7;size=54;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="880" y="96" width="190" height="894" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="7" value="&lt;b&gt;alt&lt;/b&gt;" style="shape=umlFrame;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#1e293b;width=60;height=24;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=10;fontStyle=1;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fillColor=none;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="50" y="492" width="1030" height="222" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="8" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;[not scrolled to the end | a newer disclosure is active]&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="116" y="492" width="294.39069999999987" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="9" value="" style="dashed=1;endArrow=none;strokeColor=#1e293b;html=1;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="50" y="568" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="1080" y="568" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="10" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;[ok]&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="56" y="569" width="120" height="18" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="11" value="" style="html=1;points=[];perimeter=orthogonalPerimeter;outlineConnect=0;fillColor=#e2e8f0;strokeColor=#1e293b;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="340" y="186" width="10" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="12" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;Batch(code) · GET /api/funding/batches/{code} [web ContributePage]&lt;/font&gt;" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#1e293b;fontSize=10;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;align=left;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="-1" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="135" y="190" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="345" y="190" as="targetPoint"/><mxPoint x="8" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="13" value="" style="html=1;points=[];perimeter=orthogonalPerimeter;outlineConnect=0;fillColor=#e2e8f0;strokeColor=#1e293b;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="550" y="214" width="10" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="14" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;GetBatchAsync(code)&lt;/font&gt;" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#1e293b;fontSize=10;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1" p