;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="345" y="540" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="975" y="540" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="27" value="" style="html=1;points=[];perimeter=orthogonalPerimeter;outlineConnect=0;fillColor=#e2e8f0;strokeColor=#1e293b;dashed=1;strokeColor=#64748b;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="760" y="564" width="10" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="28" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;SaveChangesAsync() — pre-order → Refunded «planned»&lt;/font&gt;" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#1e293b;fontSize=10;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=11;strokeColor=#64748b;fontColor=#64748b;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="345" y="568" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="765" y="568" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="29" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;CancelPendingPreOrdersAsync(batch) — PendingPayment pre-orders → Cancelled with their Pending PreOrderDeposit requests (case d of UC55: nothing is lost) «planned»&lt;/font&gt;" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#1e293b;fontSize=10;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=11;strokeColor=#64748b;fontColor=#64748b;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;align=left;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="350" y="616" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="350" y="640" as="targetPoint"/><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="405" y="616"/><mxPoint x="405" y="640"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="30" value="" style="html=1;points=[];perimeter=orthogonalPerimeter;outlineConnect=0;fillColor=#e2e8f0;strokeColor=#1e293b;dashed=1;strokeColor=#64748b;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="340" y="614" width="10" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="31" value="" style="html=1;points=[];perimeter=orthogonalPerimeter;outlineConnect=0;fillColor=#e2e8f0;strokeColor=#1e293b;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="760" y="654" width="10" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="32" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;Set&amp;lt;PaymentRequest&amp;gt;().Where(batch account, Contribution, Pending).ToListAsync()&lt;/font&gt;" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#1e293b;fontSize=10;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;align=left;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="-1" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="345" y="658" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="765" y="658" as="targetPoint"/><mxPoint x="8" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="33" value="" style="html=1;points=[];perimeter=orthogonalPerimeter;outlineConnect=0;fillColor=#e2e8f0;strokeColor=#1e293b;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="760" y="682" width="10" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="34" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;SaveChangesAsync() — those requests → Cancelled&lt;/font&gt;" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#1e293b;fontSize=10;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="345" y="686" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="765" y="686" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="35" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;FundingCloseResult(expiredReservations, batches[])&lt;/font&gt;" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=open;endFill=0;dashed=1;strokeColor=#475569;fontSize=10;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;align=left;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="345" y="754" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="135" y="754" as="targetPoint"/><mxPoint x="8" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="36" value="&lt;b&gt;Figure 4.38 (3/3) – Sequence Diagram: UC10, UC27 (background job) Funding Close — expire reservations; open the Batch when the minimum viable capital and the minimum pre-order ratio are reached, otherwise cancel it and refund investors and depositing Customers&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;v3.2 · 05/11/2026 · Register v1.4 · UML 2.5 · code: develop @ 420a379 · classes: Figure 4.71 onwards · modified for v1.4 · was v2.0 Figure 4.42 · legend: Index page&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="10" width="1070" height="61" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="37" value="&lt;b&gt;Notes&lt;/b&gt; · use case: UC10, UC27 (background job) · owner: Thiện · modified for v1.4&lt;br&gt;• Opening condition: a Batch opens when the confirmed capital reaches the minimum viable capital (min_viable_capital, as in code) and the pre-order ratio reaches the admin minimum (snapshot on the Batch, UC41); otherwise it is cancelled and both investors and depositing Customers are refunded. Between minimum and target capital only the boxes of funded rows go into production (capital that cannot buy whole boxes is refunded — none with row-based contributions), and settlement subtracts the locked Standard Cost of those boxes (Figure 4.40).&lt;br&gt;• Not on develop @ 420a379 («planned»): the pre-order ratio, PreOrderQuota, ReleaseUnfundedRowsAsync, ConfirmPreOrdersAsync, ForfeitCancelledDepositsAsync, RefundPreOrderDepositsAsync and CancelPendingPreOrdersAsync; the code refunds contributions only and cancels only the Pending Contribution requests.&lt;br&gt;• Refund instructions are sent by PayoutSendService (Figure 4.39); a contribution becomes Refunded when the intermediary confirms the refund. Deposit cases a–d: Figure 4.58.&lt;br&gt;• Design decisions of 05/11/2026 applied here were confirmed by the lead." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#fffbeb;strokeColor=#d97706;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="852" width="1050" height="140" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram name="UC18 UC40 Tranche &amp; payout (1 of 3)" id="UC18_UC40_Tranche__amp__payout__1_of_3_"><mxGraphModel dx="1200" dy="800" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1654" pageHeight="1169" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="c2" value="Operator Owner" style="shape=umlLifeline;participant=umlActor;perimeter=lifelinePerimeter;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;container=1;collapsible=0;recursiveResize=0;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=36;outlineConnect=0;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Segoe UI;size=54;fontSize=12;whiteSpace=nowrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="115" y="96" width="40" height="670" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c3" value="Platform Administrator" style="shape=umlLifeline;participant=umlActor;perimeter=lifelinePerimeter;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;container=1;collapsible=0;recursiveResize=0;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=36;outlineConnect=0;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Segoe UI;size=54;fontSize=12;whiteSpace=nowrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="325" y="96" width="40" height="670" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c4" value="«controller»&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;:DisbursementsController&lt;/b&gt;" style="shape=umlLifeline;perimeter=lifelinePerimeter;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;container=1;collapsible=0;recursiveResize=0;outlineConnect=0;fillColor=#f8fafc;strokeColor=#1e293b;size=40;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fillColor=#e0f2fe;size=54;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="460" y="96" width="190" height="670" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c5" value="«service»&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;:DisbursementService&lt;/b&gt;" style="shape=umlLifeline;