" style="html=1;points=[];perimeter=orthogonalPerimeter;outlineConnect=0;fillColor=#e2e8f0;strokeColor=#1e293b;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="550" y="590" width="10" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="29" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;RaiseAsync(batchId, Mortality, policy severity, message, ackWithin)&lt;/font&gt;" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#1e293b;fontSize=10;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;align=left;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="-1" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="345" y="594" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="555" y="594" as="targetPoint"/><mxPoint x="8" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="30" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;SlotEventResponse&lt;/font&gt;" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=open;endFill=0;dashed=1;strokeColor=#475569;fontSize=10;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="345" y="642" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="135" y="642" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="31" value="the same daily logs and box events can arrive from the device simulator through the Ingestion API with source FarmApi (UC52, Figure 4.49)." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#fffbeb;strokeColor=#d97706;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="90" y="690" width="950" height="34" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="32" value="&lt;b&gt;Figure 4.48 (3/3) – Sequence Diagram: UC17 Record Production Logs and Box Events — stocking, daily log, mortality with evidence&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;v3.2 · 05/11/2026 · Register v1.4 · UML 2.5 · code: develop @ 420a379 · classes: Figure 4.71 onwards · kept — refreshed against code · was v2.0 Figure 4.52 · legend: Index page&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="10" width="1070" height="42" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="33" value="&lt;b&gt;Notes&lt;/b&gt; · use case: UC17 · owner: Viên · kept — refreshed against code&lt;br&gt;• Removed in v1.4 (still in code): water-quality thresholds (ProductionThresholdVersion; ProductionLogsController.Thresholds / Configure → ProductionLogService.ThresholdsAsync / ConfigureAsync), the Ph / WaterTempC / SalinityPpt measurements and ThresholdVersionId of ProductionLog, the plausibility check Violations(request, thresholds) → OutOfRange and the WaterQuality alert; the v1.4 simulator sends only meaningful data (feeding, photos, box events) and TL-22 dropped alerts on environmental measurements. The daily log keeps feeding and notes; health and photos are recorded as box events and evidence (UC45) or sent by the simulator (UC52).&lt;br&gt;• Molted, Restocked and Relocated use the same RecordAsync; restocking replaces a dead crab within the restock cut-off (mortality reserve). A few deaths are restocked; heavier losses lower revenue for all investors pro rata (Register v1.4).&lt;br&gt;• Design decisions of 05/11/2026 applied here were confirmed by the lead." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#fffbeb;strokeColor=#d97706;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="812" width="1050" height="140" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram name="UC52 Farm device &amp; camera data (1 of 2)" id="UC52_Farm_device__amp__camera_data__1_of_2_"><mxGraphModel dx="1200" dy="800" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1654" pageHeight="1169" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="