202 Accepted «planned»&lt;/font&gt;" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=open;endFill=0;dashed=1;strokeColor=#475569;fontSize=10;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=11;strokeColor=#64748b;fontColor=#64748b;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="345" y="356" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="135" y="356" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="14" value="&lt;b&gt;Figure 4.49 (2/2) – Sequence Diagram: UC52 Submit Farm Device and Camera Data — the Device &amp; Camera Simulator posts farm data through one Ingestion API&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;v3.2 · 05/11/2026 · Register v1.4 · UML 2.5 · code: develop @ 420a379 · classes: Figure 4.71 onwards · new «planned» · new for Register v1.4 · legend: Index page&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="10" width="1020" height="61" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="15" value="&lt;b&gt;Notes&lt;/b&gt; · use case: UC52 · owner: Viên · new «planned»&lt;br&gt;• UC52 «planned» — no Ingestion API on develop @ 420a379. It replaces per-farm software integration and IoT / camera hardware (out of scope); the simulator sends only meaningful farm data (feeding, health, box events, daily logs, photos), not temperature or salinity.&lt;br&gt;• Existing hooks: Source = FarmApi is already allowed on production_log, slot_event and evidence (V001) but not written by code. Gaps: ProductionLogRequest still requires ph / waterTempC / salinityPpt; DisbursementService.GateAsync counts evidence of every source, so it must keep only InAppCapture once device photos arrive." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#fffbeb;strokeColor=#d97706;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="454" width="1000" height="95" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram name="UC53 Box details of own rows (1 of 2)" id="UC53_Box_details_of_own_rows__1_of_2_"><mxGraphModel dx="1200" dy="800" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1654" pageHeight="1169" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="c2" value="Investor" style="shape=umlLifeline;participant=umlActor;perimeter=lifelinePerimeter;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;container=1;collapsible=0;recursiveResize=0;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=36;outlineConnect=0;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Segoe UI;size=54;fontSize=12;whiteSpace=nowrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="115" y="96" width="40" height="810" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c3" value="«controller» «planned»&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;:BoxDetailsController&lt;/b&gt;" style="shape=umlLifeline;perimeter=lifelinePerimeter;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;container=1;collapsible=0;recursiveResize=0;outlineConnect=0;fillColor=#f8fafc;strokeColor=#1e293b;size=40;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fillColor=#e0f2fe;size=54;fontSize=12;dashed=1;strokeColor=#64748b;fontColor=#64748b;fillColor=#f8fafc;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="250" y="96" width="190" height="810" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c4" value="«service» «planned»&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;:BoxDetailService&lt;/b&gt;" style="shape=umlLifeline;perimeter=lifelinePerimeter;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;container=1;collapsible=0;recursiveResize=0;outlineConnect=0;fillColor=#f8fafc;strokeColor=#1e293b;size=40;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Segoe UI;size=54;fontSize=12;dashed=1;strokeColor=#64748b;fontColor=#64748b;fillColor=#f8fafc;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="460" y="96" width="190" height="810" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c5" value="«persistence»&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;:AppDbContext&lt;/b&gt;" style="shape=umlLifeline;perimeter=lifelinePerimeter;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;container=1;coll