estion module, evaluation report). The suggestion is advisory: the Operator still types pricePerKgVnd in UC07 (Figure 4.45). It is asked before the Batch exists, so PriceSuggestion.BatchId is optional and set when the Batch is saved; names follow the Logical ERD (TargetFrom / To, DataFrom / To, Source FarmInterview)." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#fffbeb;strokeColor=#d97706;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="762" width="1260" height="65" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram name="UC25 Farms on map" id="UC25_Farms_on_map"><mxGraphModel dx="1200" dy="800" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1654" pageHeight="1169" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="c2" value="Customer (bulk buyer)" style="shape=umlLifeline;participant=umlActor;perimeter=lifelinePerimeter;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;container=1;collapsible=0;recursiveResize=0;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=36;outlineConnect=0;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Segoe UI;size=54;fontSize=12;whiteSpace=nowrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="115" y="96" width="40" height="408" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c3" value="«controller» «planned»&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;:FarmMapController&lt;/b&gt;" style="shape=umlLifeline;perimeter=lifelinePerimeter;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;container=1;collapsible=0;recursiveResize=0;outlineConnect=0;fillColor=#f8fafc;strokeColor=#1e293b;size=40;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fillColor=#e0f2fe;size=54;fontSize=12;dashed=1;strokeColor=#64748b;fontColor=#64748b;fillColor=#f8fafc;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="250" y="96" width="190" height="408" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c4" value="«service» «planned»&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;:FarmMapService&lt;/b&gt;" style="shape=umlLifeline;perimeter=lifelinePerimeter;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;c