html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="130" y="244" width="470" height="32" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="9" value="" style="html=1;points=[];perimeter=orthogonalPerimeter;outlineConnect=0;fillColor=#e2e8f0;strokeColor=#1e293b;dashed=1;strokeColor=#64748b;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="550" y="294" width="10" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="10" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;OnPaidAsync(request, paidAt) — purpose OrderPayment «planned»&lt;/font&gt;" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#1e293b;fontSize=10;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=11;strokeColor=#64748b;fontColor=#64748b;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;align=left;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="-1" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="345" y="298" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="555" y="298" as="targetPoint"/><mxPoint x="8" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="11" value="" style="html=1;points=[];perimeter=orthogonalPerimeter;outlineConnect=0;fillColor=#e2e8f0;strokeColor=#1e293b;dashed=1;strokeColor=#64748b;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="130" y="322" width="10" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="12" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;SaveChangesAsync() — order → Completed, PaidAt (counted as InvoicedSale revenue) «planned»&lt;/font&gt;" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#1e293b;fontSize=10;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=11;strokeColor=#64748b;fontColor=#64748b;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;align=left;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="555" y="326" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="135" y="326" as="targetPoint"/><mxPoint x="8" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="13" value="&lt;b&gt;Figure 4.59 (2/2) – Sequence Diagram: UC50 Record Invoiced Sale — low-grade crabs (saleReason LowGrade) or crabs released by a forfeited order (saleReason ForfeitResale), sold with an invoice&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;v3.2 · 05/11/2026 · Register v1.4 · UML 2.5 · code: develop @ 420a379 · classes: Figure 4.71 onwards · new «planned» · new for Register v1.4 · legend: Index page&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="10" width="1020" height="61" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="14" value="&lt;b&gt;Notes&lt;/b&gt; · use case: UC50 · owner: Nhân · new «planned»&lt;br&gt;• One InvoicedSale order type for the low-grade sale and for the resale after a forfeit; SalesOrder.orderType ∈ {BulkPreOrder, InvoicedSale, FinalOrder}, saleReason ∈ {LowGrade, ForfeitResale}; every delivered order (BulkPreOrder, InvoicedSale, FinalOrder) has one Invoice.&lt;br&gt;• UC50 «planned»: no invoiced orders on develop @ 420a379. Existing hooks: Evidence already allows MediaType Invoice and Source DocumentUpload (V001, not written by code). Invoiced orders reuse the purpose OrderPayment, as in the Logical ERD (no CHECK change). Assumption to confirm: the buyer pays into the batch account, so the sale counts as collected revenue like every other order.&lt;br&gt;• Design decisions of 05/11/2026 applied here were confirmed by the lead." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#fffbeb;strokeColor=#d97706;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="424" width="1000" height="125" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram name="UC51 Final order (1 of 2)" id="UC51_Final_order__1_of_2_"><mxGraphModel dx="1200" dy="800" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1654" pageHeight="1169" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="c2" value="«background job» «planned»&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;:FinalOrderReminderJob&lt;/b&gt;" style="shape=umlLifeline;perimeter=lifelinePerimeter;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;container=1;collapsible=0;recursiveResize=0;outlineConnect=0;fillColor=#f8fafc;strokeColor=#1e293b;size=40;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fillColor=#ede9fe;size=54;fontSize=12;dashed=1;strokeColor=#64748b;fontColor=#64748b;fillColor=#f8fafc;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="96" width="190" height="486" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c3" value="«service»&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;:AlertService&lt;/b&gt;" style="shape=umlLifeline;perimeter=lifelinePerimeter;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;container=1;collapsible=0;recursiveResize=0;outlineConnect=0;fillColor=#f8fafc;strokeColor=#1e293b;size=40;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Segoe UI;size=54;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="250" y="96" width="190" height="486" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c4" value="Operator Owner" style="shape=umlLifeline;participant=umlActor;perimeter=lifelinePerimeter;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;container=1;collapsible=0;recursiveResize=0;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=36;outlineConnect=0;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Segoe UI;size=54;fontSize=12;whiteSpace=nowrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="535" y="96" width="40" height="486" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c5" value="«controller» «planned»&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;:InvoicedSalesController&lt;/b&gt;" style="shape=umlLifeline;perimeter=lifelinePerimeter;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;container=1;collapsible=0;recursiveResize=0;outlineConnect=0;fillColor=#f8fafc;strokeColor=#1e293b;size=40;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fillColor=#e0f2fe;size=54;fontSize=12;dashed=1;strokeColor=#64748b;fontColor=#64748b;fillColor=#f8fafc;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="670" y="96" width="190" height="486" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c6" value="«service» «planned»&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;:InvoicedSaleService&lt;/b&gt;" style="shape=umlLifeline;perimeter=lifelinePerimeter;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;container=1;collapsible=0;recursiveResize=0;outlineConnect=0;fillColor=#f8fafc;strokeColor=#1e293b;size=40;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Segoe UI;size=54;fontSize=12;dashed=1;strokeColor=#64748b;fontColor=#64748b;fillColor=#f8fafc;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="880" y="96" width="190" height="486" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c7" value="«persistence»&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;:AppDbContext&lt;/b&gt;" style="shape=umlLifeline;perimeter=lifelinePerimeter;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;container=1;collapsible=0;recursiveResize=0;outlineConnect=0;fillColor=#f8fafc;strokeColor=#1e293b;size=40;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fillColor=#f1f5f9;size=54;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1090" y="96" width="190" height="486" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c8" value="«interface»&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;:IAuditLog&lt;/b&gt;" style="shape=umlLifeline;perimeter=lifelinePerimeter;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;container=1;collapsible=0;recursiveResize=0;outlineConnect=0;fillColor=#f8fafc;strokeColor=#1e293b;size=40;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fillColor=#fef3c7;size=54;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1300" y="96" width="190" height="486" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="9" value="" style="html=1;points=[];perimeter=orthogonalPerimeter;outlineConnect=0;fillColor=#e2e8f0;strokeColor=#1e293b;dashed=1;strokeColor=#64748b;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1180" y="186" width="10" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="10" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;Set&amp;lt;Batch&amp;gt;().Where(Harvesting, sales window of SalesWindowDays closed, leftover crabs, no FinalOrder).ToListAsync() «planned»&lt;/font&gt;" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#1e293b;fontSize=10;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=11;strokeColor=#64748b;fontColor=#64748b;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1" parent="