one;strokeColor=#1e293b;width=60;height=24;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=10;fontStyle=1;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fillColor=#ffffff;width=40;height=20;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="80" y="548" width="970" height="32" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="26" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;the buyer pays into the batch account; InvoicedSalePaymentHandler.OnPaidAsync completes the order (Figure 4.59) — counted as FinalOrder revenue (Figure 4.40)&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="130" y="550" width="890" height="28" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="27" value="&lt;b&gt;Figure 4.60 (2/2) – Sequence Diagram: UC51 Record Final Order at Floor Price — leftover stock to the committed buyer, never below the floor price&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;v3.2 · 05/11/2026 · Register v1.4 · UML 2.5 · code: develop @ 420a379 · classes: Figure 4.71 onwards · new «planned» · new for Register v1.4 · legend: Index page&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="10" width="1070" height="61" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="28" value="&lt;b&gt;Notes&lt;/b&gt; · use case: UC51 · owner: Nhân · new «planned»&lt;br&gt;• UC51 «planned»: final order, floor price column, FinalOrderReminderJob and the FinalOrderDue alert type (alert.alert_type CHECK) are not on develop @ 420a379. The committed buyer's resale channel is out of scope.&lt;br&gt;• Research invariant (Register v1.4, section 3.3, objective O1): the final order is never below the floor price; each forfeited deposit is counted once.&lt;br&gt;• Design decisions of 05/11/2026 applied here were confirmed by the lead." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;s