rokeColor=#1e293b;fontSize=10;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;align=left;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="345" y="242" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="135" y="242" as="targetPoint"/><mxPoint x="8" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="9" value="" style="html=1;points=[];perimeter=orthogonalPerimeter;outlineConnect=0;fillColor=#e2e8f0;strokeColor=#1e293b;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="550" y="266" width="10" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="10" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;RaiseAsync(batchId, EvidenceFlag, Medium, message, 2 h)&lt;/font&gt;" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#1e293b;fontSize=10;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;align=left;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="-1" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="345" y="270" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="555" y="270" as="targetPoint"/><mxPoint x="8" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="11" value="&lt;b&gt;Figure 4.66 (3/3) – Sequence Diagram: UC45 Capture Production Evidence — live photo, hashing, crab detection module, risk score, capture request&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;v3.2 · 05/11/2026 · Register v1.4 · UML 2.5 · code: develop @ 420a379 · classes: Figure 4.71 onwards · modified for v1.4 · was v2.0 Figure 4.68 · legend: Index page&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="10" width="1020" height="61" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="12" value="&lt;b&gt;Notes&lt;/b&gt; · use case: UC45 · owner: Khôi · modified for v1.4&lt;br&gt;• v1.4: the crab detection module only checks whether a crab is present in the box photo; its weight in the risk score is capped (≤ 15), so detection never rejects evidence alone — Flagged photos go to the human Evidence Reviewer (UC47, Figure 4.67). develop @ 420a379 wires NoopCrabDetector (&quot;no conclusion&quot;); the trained detection module behind ICrabDetector is «planned».&lt;br&gt;• Removed in v1.4 (still in code): the tagCode path of UploadAsync (confirmation photo of a printed crab tag for UC46)." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#fffbeb;strokeColor=#d97706;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="368" width="1000" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram name="UC47 UC48 Review evidence (1 of 2)" id="UC47_UC48_Review_evidence__1_of_2_"><mxGraphModel dx="1200" dy="800" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1654" pageHeight="1169" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="c2" value="Evidence Reviewer (Platform Administrator)" style="shape=umlLifeline;participant=umlActor;perimeter=lifelinePerimeter;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;container=1;collapsible=0;recursiveResize=0;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=36;outlineConnect=0;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Segoe UI;size=54;fontSize=12;whiteSpace=nowrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="115" y="96" width="40" height="672" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c3" value="«controller»&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;:EvidenceReviewController&lt;/b&gt;" style="shape=umlLifeline;perimeter=lifelinePerimeter;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;container=1;collapsible=0;recursiveResize=0;outlineConnect=0;fillColor=#f8fafc;strokeColor=#1e293b;size=40;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fillColor=#e0f2fe;size=54;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="250" y="96" width="190" height="672" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c4" value="«service»&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;:EvidenceReviewService&lt;/b&gt;" style="shape=umlLifeline;perimeter=lifelinePerim